  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCR, Centre for Conflict Resolution               Core support 2012-2017 - CCR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCR, Centre for Conflict Resolution               K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d 2012-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centre for Conflict Resolution (CCR), based in South Africa,      contributes to a just and sustainable peace in Africa by              strengthening the capacity of African institutions and actors to      manage conflicts in their own region and by influencing policy and    academic debates. CCR receives programme support from Sida for        2012-2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Centre for Conflict Resolution (CCR), med bas i Sydafrika, bidrar till en r&#xe4;ttvis och h&#xe5;llbar fred i Afrika genom att st&#xe4;rka            kapaciteten hos Afrikanska institutioner och akt&#xf6;rer att hantera      konflikter i deras respektive regioner och genom att p&#xe5;verka policy   och akademiska debatter. CCR f&#xe5;r programst&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r 2012-2015.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of CCR&apos;s Africa Programme is to continue to contribute towards a just and sustainable peace in Africa. The immediate objective is to strengthen the capacity of African institutions and actors to manage conflicts in their own region.</narrative>
  </description>
